sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Citizen WhatsApp
    participant WA as WhatsApp API
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Trans as Sarvam AI Translation
    participant QU as Query Understanding
    participant VDB as Qdrant Vector DB
    participant Rerank as Cohere Reranker
    participant LLM as Claude Sonnet
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant LF as Langfuse

    User->>WA: Sends message in Hindi
    WA->>API: Webhook POST /webhook/whatsapp
    API->>Auth: Verify user phone number
    Auth-->>API: User profile + quota

    API->>API: Check free quota 10/day
    alt Quota exceeded
        API->>WA: Daily limit reached
        WA->>User: Subscription prompt
    end

    API->>Trans: Detect language + translate
    Trans-->>API: English translation

    API->>QU: Extract domain jurisdiction acts urgency
    QU-->>API: Classification result

    API->>VDB: Hybrid search dense + sparse with metadata filter
    VDB-->>API: Top 20 candidate chunks

    API->>Rerank: Rerank 20 chunks
    Rerank-->>API: Top 8 reranked chunks

    API->>API: Assemble context with metadata and citations

    API->>LLM: System prompt + context + query
    LLM-->>API: Grounded answer + confidence 0.91

    API->>API: Inject citations + disclaimer

    API->>Trans: Translate response to Hindi
    Trans-->>API: Hindi response

    API->>DB: Log query response tokens latency
    API->>LF: Track cost latency quality

    API->>WA: Send formatted response
    WA->>User: Legal info in Hindi with citations
